+ '<h4 style="color:#c8a96e;margin:24px 0 10px">1.3 — Knowledge Distillation</h4>'
+ '<p class="l-text">Knowledge distillation trains a small <em>student</em> model to mimic a large <em>teacher</em> model\'s output distribution, not just its hard labels. The result is a permanently smaller architecture with near-teacher performance. DistilBERT is BERT-base distilled to 66M parameters (vs 110M) — 40% smaller, 60% faster, 97% of the accuracy.</p>'

